# Agent instruction files
# CLAUDE.md is a shared project guide and is tracked with the root live docs.
# AGENTS.md is an identical real-file copy of CLAUDE.md for tools that only
# load AGENTS.md (ZCode/Codex); tracked so every checkout gets the rules.

# docs/ is fully version-controlled: governance docs, plans, specs, reviews,
# completion/audit reports, archive/, upstream-memory/, protocol/, assets/.
# Owner opted in to tracking all docs work notes (2026-07-29); the former
# local-only ignore block (/docs/* + selective re-includes) was abolished.

